00:02:09.149 --> 00:02:14.229
The unrest in recent weeks has included strikes and sometimes violent protests, so the meeting

00:02:14.229 --> 00:02:18.769
is being staged under pressure, with a wage rise discussed and the Treasury's room to

00:02:18.769 --> 00:02:24.746
pay for one still tightly bound. Somalia's opposition coalition, the Somali Future Council,

00:02:25.306 --> 00:02:29.786
accused President Hassan Sheikh Mohammed of using security forces to take control of the

00:02:29.786 --> 00:02:35.206
Supreme Court. An accusation issued from Mogadishu that escalates a confrontation over judicial

00:02:35.206 --> 00:02:40.086
independence and the president's mandate. All Africa's Shabel report presented that

00:02:40.086 --> 00:02:45.686
charge as a direct challenge to the institutional separation of powers, and recorded the opposition's

00:02:45.686 --> 00:02:50.046
