00:02:50.426 --> 00:02:54.866
The Somali Future Council framed the action as an attempt to undermine the independence

00:02:54.866 --> 00:02:59.346
of the judiciary, and the fight centers on who holds the president's mandate and who

00:02:59.346 --> 00:03:03.906
controls key state institutions, including the court that sits at the top of the legal

00:03:03.906 --> 00:03:04.346
system.

